---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="">
<Verticalgrid />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-24 lg:px-16 md:px-12 px-8 xl:px-18 items-center lg:py-24 relative w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="mt-8">The Tools You Need To Grow Repeat Sales</h2>
      <p class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-4">Points, VIP, referrals, gift cards, and store credit work seamlessly together to create the ultimate rewards program for your business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-16">
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 via-indigo-500/5 rounded-3xl">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Shopify gift cards" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-GC.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Gift Card Management</h3>
              <p class="mt-2"><b>Creation & Issuance:</b> Easily create and issue physical and digital gift cards with customizable designs and values.
                <br /><b>Bulk Creation:</b> Generate multiple gift cards at once for events or promotions.<br />
                <b>Balance Checks :</b> Allow customers to easily check their gift card balances.<br />
<b>Expiry Dates :</b> Set expiration dates for gift cards to encourage timely redemption.<br />
<b>Reloading :</b> Enable customers to reload existing gift cards.

              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 via-indigo-500/5 rounded-3xl">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify loyalty program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-LP.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Loyalty <br /> Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 "><b>Points Accumulation:</b> Award points to customers based on their purchase history.<br />
                <b>Tiered Rewards:</b> Create different tiers with increasing rewards for loyal customers.<br />
                <b>Redemption Options :</b> Offer flexible redemption options, such as discounts, free products, or exclusive offers.<br />
<b>Automated Rewards :</b> Automatically apply rewards to customer accounts.
                </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 via-indigo-500/5 rounded-3xl">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify store credit" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-SC.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Store Credit Management</h3>
              <p class="mt-2"><b>Issuance:</b> Issue store credit to customers for returns, refunds, or as part of promotions.<br />
                 <b>Redemption:</b> Allow customers to easily redeem store credit towards future purchases. <br />
                 <b>Expiration Dates :</b> Set expiration dates for store credit to encourage timely use.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 via-indigo-500/5 rounded-3xl">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify referral program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-Rf.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Referral <br /> Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2"><b>Referral Incentives :</b> Encourage customer referrals by offering rewards to both the referrer and the referred customer.<br />
<b>Tracking & Reporting :</b> Track the performance of your referral program and identify top referrers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
     
    </div>
  </div>
   <div class="flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl gap-2 mx-auto sm:flex-row">
   <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 lg:mb-14">
          <a href="https://apps.shopify.com/99minds-gift-card-loyalty-referral#" target="_blank" class="raise relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium">
                <span class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff8a05] via-[#ff5478] to-[#ff00c6] group-hover:from-[#ff00c6] group-hover:via-[#ff5478] group-hover:to-[#ff8a05] absolute"></span>
                <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
                <span class="relative text-white">Install 99minds on Shopify</span>
                </span>
          </a>
      </div>
      </div>
</section>
